    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d258">

                <pb facs="0238" n="224" sameAs="frus:frus1942v06/pg224"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.12/41</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Lane</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 853</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-09-26">September 26,
                        1942</date>.<lb/>[Received October 5.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to my telegram
                    no. 1237 of September 25, 1 p.m., 1942, and to enclose a draft of the proposed
                    agreement with the Colombian Government which was drawn up after conferences
                    between Mr. Rockefeller and Mr. McClintock and President López and the Minister
                    of Labor.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Arthur Bliss Lane</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d258-a1.xml" xpointer="d258-a1"/>
            </div>
